        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:13pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Since treasury shares are not considered outstanding for share count purposes, the common shares held by Maiden Reinsurance are excluded from the average number of common shares outstanding for basic and diluted earnings per share. </font>
