        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The overall lower quartile and upper quartile Deal Value/EBITDA multiples observed for the selected transactions were 14.3x and 18.1x, respectively (with a median of 15.7x and mean of 16.2x). </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Based on the results of the foregoing calculations and IAP&#8217;s professional judgment and experience, IAP applied a reference range of Deal Value/EBITDA multiples of 15.0x to 17.0x to Kestrel&#8217;s 11/30/2024 Adjusted Last Twelve Months (&#8220;LTM&#8221;) EBITDA of $10.8&#160;million based on Management Projections to derive a range of implied enterprise value of Kestrel of $162&#160;million to $183&#160;million. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Discounted Cash Flow Analysis</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IAP performed an illustrative discounted cash flow analysis on Kestrel to derive a range of illustrative enterprise values for Kestrel. Using the mid-year convention for </font>
        </div>
