      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Corporate Governance Committee, each comprised entirely of independent directors within the meaning of the rules of the Nasdaq. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">It is expected that the Bermuda NewCo board will determine the committees on which the directors of Bermuda NewCo will serve. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:12pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Executive Officers</font><font style="font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
