        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:13.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">A reconciliation of the differences between the effective tax rate and the federal statutory tax rate from continuing operations for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2024 and 2023 are as follows: </font>
        </div>
