                <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Subject to the Maiden bye-laws and to any resolution of the Maiden shareholders to the contrary, and without prejudice to any special rights previously conferred on the holders of any existing shares or class of shares, the Maiden board shall have the power to issue any unissued shares on</font>
              </td>
              <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
              <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
              <td style="padding:0pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt; width:162pt;">&#8203;</td>
