        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Bermuda NewCo Shareholder Approval</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; has the meaning set forth in </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;7.13(b)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Bermuda NewCo Shares</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; means the common stock, par value $0.01 per share, of Bermuda NewCo. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Burdensome Condition</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; has the meaning set forth in </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;7.05(e)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">business day</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; means a day except a Saturday, a Sunday or other day on which the SEC or banks in the City of New York, Dallas, Texas or Bermuda are authorized or required by applicable Law to be closed. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
