          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Company Board</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; has the meaning set forth in </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.03(a)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">. </font>
