          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Company Certificate of Formation</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; means the Company&#8217;s Certificate of Formation, as amended up to and including the five (5)&#160;business days prior to the date of this Agreement. </font>
