          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Company Material Adverse Effect</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; means any effect, change, circumstance or event that, individually or in the aggregate with all other effects, changes, circumstances or events, has, or would reasonably be </font>
