          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">plan, program, policy, agreement or other arrangement required by applicable Law, sponsored by a Governmental Authority), whether or not in writing and whether or not funded, in each case, that is sponsored, maintained or contributed to (or required to be sponsored, maintained or contributed to) by the Company or any of its Affiliates or with respect to which the Company or any of its Affiliates has any actual or contingent liability. </font>
