        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Dissenting Shares</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; means Parent Shares held by a holder of Parent Shares who (a)&#160;did not vote in favor of the First Merger, (b)&#160;complied with all of the provisions of the Bermuda Companies Act concerning the right of holders of Parent Shares to require appraisal of their Parent Shares pursuant to the Bermuda Companies Act and (c)&#160;did not fail to exercise such right to appraisal or did not deliver an Appraisal Withdrawal. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">DLLCA</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; means the Delaware Limited Liability Company Act. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Earnout Shares</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; has the meaning set forth in </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;2.01(b)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">. </font>
