        <div style="margin-left:40pt; margin-top:8pt; width:416pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">If so, please answer the remaining questions in this section. </font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">If the Selling Securityholder is a registered broker-dealer, please indicate whether the Selling Securityholder acquired its Registrable Securities for investment or acquired them as transaction-based compensation for investment banking or similar services. </font></div>
        <div style="margin-left:40pt; margin-top:8pt; width:416pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8199;</font>
        </div>
