          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">(i)</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:8.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:60pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Please describe the affiliation between the Selling Securityholder and any registered broker-dealers: </font>
        </div>
