        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:10.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:60pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">If the Selling Securityholder, at the time of its acquisition of the Registrable Securities, had any agreements or understandings, directly or indirectly, with any person to distribute the Registrable Securities, please describe such agreements or understandings: </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
