          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Note that if the Selling Securityholder is an affiliate of a broker-dealer and at the time of the acquisition of the Registrable Securities had any agreements or understandings, directly or indirectly, to distribute the securities, the Company must identify the Selling Securityholder as an underwriter in the prospectus.</font><font style="font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
