        <div style=" margin-top:7.5pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Beneficial Ownership of Registrable Securities: </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">This Item (3)&#160;covers beneficial ownership of the Company&#8217;s securities. Please consult </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Appendix&#160;A</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> to this Notice, Agreement and Questionnaire for information as to the meaning of &#8220;beneficial ownership.&#8221; Except as set forth below in this Item (3), the Selling Securityholder does not beneficially own any Registrable Securities. </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
